   "company": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "PP1-Q2",
   "paper": "PP1",
   "q": "2",
   "part": "",
   "kind": "part",
   "section": "",
   "marks": 3,
   "figure": "",
   "lead": "",
   "html": "<p>Work out <em>16<sup>3/4</sup> &times; 2<sup>&minus;2</sup></em>.</p>",
   "answer": "<p>2. 16<sup>3/4</sup> = 8 and 2<sup>&minus;2</sup> = 1/4, so 8 &times; 1/4 = 2.</p>",
   "answerType": "calculation",
   "needsPrint": false,
   "examinerNote": "",
   "examinerReport": "",
   "guide": "",
   "name": "Practice Paper 1 (Non-calculator)",
   "subject": "Maths",
   "tier": "Higher",
   "keystage": "KS4",
   "examBoard": "@family.",
   "resourceType": "Past paper",
   "year": 2026,
   "bandType": "",
   "bandValue": "",
   "examWave": "",
   "company": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "PP1-Q3",
   "paper": "PP1",
   "q": "3",
   "part": "",
   "kind": "part",
   "section": "",
   "marks": 4,
   "figure": "",
   "lead": "",
   "html": "<p>Work out <em>(4.8 &times; 10<sup>5</sup>) &divide; (1.2 &times; 10<sup>&minus;2</sup>)</em>. Give your answer in standard form.</p>",
   "answer": "<p>4 &times; 10<sup>7</sup>. 4.8 &divide; 1.2 = 4, and 10<sup>5 &minus; (&minus;2)</sup> = 10<sup>7</sup>.</p>",
   "answerType": "calculation",
   "needsPrint": false,
   "examinerNote": "",
   "examinerReport": "",
   "guide": "",
   "name": "Practice Paper 1 (Non-calculator)",
   "subject": "Maths",
   "tier": "Higher",
   "keystage": "KS4",
   "examBoard": "@family.",
   "resourceType": "Past paper",
   "year": 2026,
   "bandType": "",
   "bandValue": "",
   "examWave": "",
   "company": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "PP1-Q4",
   "paper": "PP1",
   "q": "4",
   "part": "",
   "kind": "part",
   "section": "",
   "marks": 3,
   "figure": "",
   "lead": "",
   "html": "<p>In a sale, a coat is reduced by 30%. The sale price is &pound;84. Work out the price before the sale.</p>",
   "answer": "<p>&pound;120. The sale price is 70% of the original, so 84 &divide; 0.7 = 120.</p>",
   "answerType": "calculation",
   "needsPrint": false,
   "examinerNote": "",
   "examinerReport": "",
   "guide": "",
   "name": "Practice Paper 1 (Non-calculator)",
   "subject": "Maths",
   "tier": "Higher",
   "keystage": "KS4",
   "examBoard": "@family.",
   "resourceType": "Past paper",
   "year": 2026,
