   "company": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "PP1-Q6b",
   "paper": "PP1",
   "q": "6",
   "part": "b",
   "kind": "part",
   "section": "",
   "marks": 2,
   "figure": "",
   "lead": "",
   "html": "<p>Ali says that 200 is a term in this sequence. Is he right? You must show your working.</p>",
   "answer": "<p>No. 6n &minus; 1 = 200 gives n = 33.5, which is not a whole number, so 200 is not a term.</p>",
   "answerType": "calculation",
   "needsPrint": false,
   "examinerNote": "",
   "examinerReport": "",
   "guide": "",
