   "q": "7",
   "part": "",
   "kind": "part",
   "section": "",
   "marks": 4,
   "figure": "",
   "lead": "",
   "html": "<p>Expand and simplify <em>(2x &minus; 3)(x + 4)(x &minus; 1)</em>.</p>",
   "answer": "<p>2x<sup>3</sup> + 3x<sup>2</sup> &minus; 17x + 12. First (2x &minus; 3)(x + 4) = 2x<sup>2</sup> + 5x &minus; 12, then multiply by (x &minus; 1).</p>",
   "answerType": "calculation",
